WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Algeciras, on the Bay of the Strait of Gibraltar.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Aerial view of the city and its port.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The port of Algeciras is one of the most important in Spain.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The Strait separates Spain from Morocco.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The city grows between the port and the hills.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A tour of Algeciras from the air.
